{'symbol': 'CI', 'date': '2023-02-09 09:00:00', 'title': 'CIGNA CORPORATION ANNOUNCES APPEARANCE AT THE 43RD ANNUAL COWEN HEALTH CARE CONFERENCE', 'text': 'BLOOMFIELD, CONN. , FEB. 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0GLOBAL HEALTH SERVICES COMPANY CIGNA CORPORATION (NYSE:CI) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT BRIAN EVANKO, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, WILL PRESENT AT THE 43RD \xa0ANNUAL COWEN HEALTH CARE CONFERENCE ON MARCH 6, 2023 IN BOSTON, MA.'}